52
00:07:26,264 --> 00:07:41,192
[Host] That's all for today. An aquarium in Okinawa became the first in the world to hatch baby opah, a big warm-bodied ocean fish, and the tiny transparent babies are now on display. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

